        `the amounts` IS `declined where the year changes the tax`
        `the placing` IS `section 121(b)(1) — the reading this row takes of where the eligible income sits on the scale`
        `the age`     IS `section 121(b)(1) — the reading this row takes of when the age of 60 is tested`

`the readings, share rounded` MEANS
    `The readings of the withholding rules` WITH
